#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Accounting:</strong> Full financial tracking and reporting."
msgstr "<strong>ການບັນຊີ:</strong> ການຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ລາຍງານການເງິນແບບຄົບວົງຈອນ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Contacts:</strong> Maintain donor, community partner and customer\n"
"                    information."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລາຍຊື່ຕິດຕໍ່:</strong> ຄຸ້ມຄອງຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ບໍລິຈາກ, ຄູ່ຮ່ວມງານຊຸມຊົນ ແລະ ລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Employees App:</strong>  Centralize information for all your staff "
"members and volunteers in one secure directory."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບພະນັກງານ:</strong> ລວມສູນຂໍ້ມູນພະນັກງານ ແລະ ອາສາສະໝັກທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ໃນລະບົບທີ່ປ"
"ອດໄພບ່ອນດຽວ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Inventory:</strong> Gain deeper insight into donation stock and "
"turnover."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ສາງສິນຄ້າ:</strong> ເຂົ້າໃຈຂໍ້ມູນເຊີງເລິກກ່ຽວກັບສິນຄ້າບໍລິຈາກໃນສາງ ແລະ ອັດຕາການໝູນວຽນ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Keep shifts balanced:</strong> Plan employee coverage across peak "
"hours\n"
"                    (weekends, donation drive days)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຮັກສາຄວາມສົມດຸນຂອງກະວຽກ:</strong> ວາງແຜນຈັດສັນພະນັກງານໃຫ້ພຽງພໍໃນຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ມີລູກຄ້າ"
"ຫຼາຍ\n"
"                    (ທ້າຍອາທິດ, ມື້ເປີດຮັບບໍລິຈາກ)."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Leaves:</strong> Easily manage employee's time off and plan work\n"
"                    accordingly."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການລາພັກ:</strong> ຄຸ້ມຄອງການລາພັກຂອງພະນັກງານໄດ້ງ່າຍດາຍ ແລະ ວາງແຜນວຽກງານ\n"
"                    ໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Leverage promotions:</strong> Use Odoo POS’s discount and pricing "
"rules\n"
"                    for events like “fill a bag” sales."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ນຳໃຊ້ໂປຣໂມຊັນ:</strong> ນຳໃຊ້ລະບຽບການຫຼຸດລາຄາ ແລະ ການກຳນົດລາຄາຂອງ Odoo "
"POS\n"
"                    ສຳລັບກິດຈະກຳຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ການຂາຍແບບ “ຢັດເຕັມຖົງ”."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Planning App:</strong> Organize shifts and schedules easily, "
"ensuring you always have enough hands on deck for sorting and sales."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບການວາງແຜນ:</strong> ຈັດຕາຕະລາງກະວຽກໄດ້ງ່າຍດາຍ, ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີກຳລັງຄົນພຽງພໍ"
"ສະເໝີສຳລັບການຄັດແຍກ ແລະ ຂາຍສິນຄ້າ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Point of Sale App:</strong> Process transactions quickly with a "
"flexible checkout system that supports sales by product, fixed amount, or "
"weight."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບຈຸດຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານ (POS):</strong> ດຳເນີນທຸລະກຳໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວດ້ວຍລະບົບຄິດໄລ່ເງິນທີ່ຢືດຢຸ່"
"ນ ຮອງຮັບການຂາຍຕາມສິນຄ້າ, ຕາມລາຄາກຳນົດ, ຫຼື ຕາມນ້ຳໜັກ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Purchase:</strong> Manage store supply needs (bags, hangers, "
"cleaning\n"
"                    supplies)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຈັດຊື້:</strong> ຄຸ້ມຄອງອຸປະກອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນພາຍໃນຮ້ານ (ຖົງ, ໄມ້ແຂວນເຄື່ອງ, ອຸປະກອນ\n"
"                    ທຳຄວາມສະອາດ)."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Standardize categories:</strong> Use consistent product categories "
"(e.g.,\n"
"                    clothing, books, household) to keep reporting clear."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ກຳນົດໝວດໝູ່ໃຫ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ:</strong> ນຳໃຊ້ໝວດໝູ່ສິນຄ້າໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ:\n"
"                    ເຄື່ອງນຸ່ງ, ປຶ້ມ, ເຄື່ອງໃຊ້ໃນເຮືອນ) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລາຍງານມີຄວາມຈະແຈ້ງ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Train your staff:</strong> Volunteers and part-time staff pick up "
"faster\n"
"                    with Odoo’s intuitive POS interface."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຝຶກອົບຮົມພະນັກງານ:</strong> ອາສາສະໝັກ ແລະ ພະນັກງານນອກເວລາສາມາດຮຽນຮູ້ໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ\n"
"                    ດ້ວຍໜ້າຕ່າງ POS ຂອງ Odoo ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານງ່າຍ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Website:</strong> Showcase your mission and events online."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເວັບໄຊ:</strong> ສະແດງພາລະກິດ ແລະ ກິດຈະກຳຕ່າງໆ ຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານທາງອອນລາຍ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>eCommerce:</strong> Sell select high-value items online to reach "
"wider\n"
"                    audiences."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ອີຄອມເມີຊ:</strong> ຂາຍສິນຄ້າລາຄາສູງທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ຜ່ານອອນລາຍ ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ\n"
"                    ກຸ່ມລູກຄ້າທີ່ກວ້າງຂວາງກວ່າເກົ່າ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model:product.template,name:thrift_store.product_template_12
msgid "Accessories"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງປະດັບ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນເສີມ"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Add a product to the order, 10 for example, and adjust the count per the\n"
"                        number of pieces with that price in the customer "
"basket!"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມສິນຄ້າເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ ເຊັ່ນ: 10, ແລະ ປັບຈຳນວນຕາມ\n"
"                        ຈຳນວນຊິ້ນທີ່ມີລາຄານັ້ນຢູ່ໃນກະຕ່າຂອງລູກຄ້າ!"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Add the product labelled By Weight and adjust the quantity per measured\n"
"                        weight"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມສິນຄ້າທີ່ຕິດປ້າຍວ່າ ຕາມນ້ຳໜັກ ແລະ ປັບຈຳນວນຕາມນ້ຳໜັກ\n"
"                        ທີ່ຊັ່ງໄດ້"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjust the shift time, specify the role and save it"
msgstr "ປັບເວລາຂອງກະວຽກ, ລະບຸໜ້າທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບ ແລະ ບັນທຶກ"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model:pos.category,name:thrift_store.pos_category_1
msgid "Amounts"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນເງິນ"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid "Basics"
msgstr "ພື້ນຖານ"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click on the planning to add a new shift"
msgstr "ກົດໃສ່ຕາຕະລາງແຜນງານເພື່ອເພີ່ມກະວຽກໃໝ່"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid "Discover more about Odoo by diving into our"
msgstr "ຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Odoo ໂດຍການສຶກສາເບິ່ງ"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Discover the basics of this package and explore all the possibilities Odoo "
"offers to\n"
"            improve your experience."
msgstr ""
"ຄົ້ນຫາພື້ນຖານຂອງແພັກເກດນີ້ ແລະ ສຳຫຼວດທຸກຄວາມສາມາດທີ່ Odoo ມອບໃຫ້\n"
"            ເພື່ອປັບປຸງປະສົບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid "Do You Want to Go Further?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສຶກສາເພີ່ມເຕີມບໍ່?"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Employees can have multiple roles. Those are defined in their employee "
"record."
msgstr ""
"ພະນັກງານສາມາດມີຫຼາຍໜ້າທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບ. ໜ້າທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນປະຫວັດພະນັກງານຂອງພວກເຂົາ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "ສະບາຍດີ!"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Here are different ways you can configure your products depending on your "
"pricing model."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຫຼາຍໆ ວິທີທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າສິນຄ້າ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງລາຄາຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you want to execute a practical guided tour of this module, you should "
"Import\n"
"                    demo data and try the Demo - Use Case (In the next "
"Knowledge Article)"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການທົດລອງນຳໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້ຕົວຈິງ, ທ່ານຄວນນຳເຂົ້າ\n"
"                    ຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ ແລະ ທົດລອງກໍລະນີສຶກສາຕົວຢ່າງ (ໃນບົດຄວາມຄວາມຮູ້ຖັດໄປ)"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid "In practice"
msgstr "ໃນການປະຕິບັດຕົວຈິງ"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model:product.template,name:thrift_store.product_template_13
msgid "Jackets"
msgstr "ເສື້ອແຈັກເກັດ"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid "Leverage the shift templates to efficiently populate the planning!"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບກະວຽກ ເພື່ອຈັດຕາຕະລາງແຜນງານໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ ແລະ ມີປະສິດທິພາບ!"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid "Odoo for Thrift Store"
msgstr "Odoo ສຳລັບຮ້ານຂາຍເຄື່ອງມືສອງ"

#. module: thrift_store
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:thrift_store.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once your week plan is ready, Publish it to share their shifts with your\n"
"                        employees"
msgstr ""
